                    Brand Promoter for Hattori



Hattori is a PvP/P2E mobile game about ancient Japan. We have a ready game and a
 app. Players can play the game and earn tokens. The game is free.



We're looking for brand promoters in different cities.



What you'll do:



— find people in your city and ask them to download the game;

— tell people about Hattori and how they can earn tokens;

— promote the game on the street, with flyers, in chats, in local groups, at events, or in any other way;

— help new players make the first steps and connect their game account to the
 app;

— grow your referral tree and earn more.



Income:



You can earn from $50 to $300 per month.



Your income depends on how much time you can work and how good your communication with people is.



Schedule:



— 5/2;

— flexible working time;

— work in any place in your city;

— you can combine this work with study or another job.



Requirements:



— no experience needed;

— good communication with people;

— active and responsible;

— desire to earn.



